sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Agent
    participant C as InMemorySaver
    U->>A: "My favorite number is 42." (thread=alice)
    A->>C: save state
    A-->>U: "Noted."
    U->>A: "What is my favorite number?" (thread=alice)
    A->>C: load state for alice
    C-->>A: earlier messages
    A-->>U: "42"
    U->>A: "What is my favorite number?" (thread=bob)
    A->>C: load state for bob
    C-->>A: (empty)
    A-->>U: "I don't know"
